<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Echlin raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Echlin raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded Echlin Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Price target is $40 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 34-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
